{{also|Grow}}
==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*gʰreh₁-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|growen}}, from {{inh|en|ang|grōwan|t=to grow, increase, flourish, germinate}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*grōan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*grōaną|t=to grow, grow green}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*gʰreh₁-|t=to grow, become green}}.
{{rel-top|cognates}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|grow}}, {{m|sco|grew||to grow}}, {{cog|frr|grojen}}, {{m|frr|growen||to grow}}, {{cog|fy|groeie||to grow}}, {{cog|nl|groeien||to grow}}, {{cog|nds-de|grojen||to green; thrive; take hold; flourish}}, {{cog|gmh|grüejen||to grow, grow green}}, {{cog|da|gro||to grow}}, {{cog|no|gro||to grow}}, {{cog|sv|gro||to germinate, grow, sprout}}, {{cog|is|gróa||to grow}}, {{cog|la|herba||plant, herb, weed}}, {{cog|sv|gröda||crop}}, {{cog|frr|greyde||growth, pasture}}. Related to [[growth]], [[grass]], [[green]].
{{rel-bottom}}

